{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "%@ 账号需要验证码": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The %@ account needs a verification code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 个": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 个结果": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld results"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IPA Depot": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IPA Depot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IPA Depot 现在支持保存多个账号、一键切换地区。已为当前登录的账号建好一条记录，请选一下它所在的地区，方便在侧栏区分。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IPA Depot can now save multiple accounts and switch regions in one click. A record was created for the account you are signed in with; choose its region so you can tell accounts apart in the sidebar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IPA Depot 许可（MIT）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IPA Depot License (MIT)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MIT 许可": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MIT License"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 登录密码": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac login password"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ipatool": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ipatool"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ipatool 第一次登录时会下载运行所需的组件，可能需要几分钟，请保持网络畅通。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first time you sign in, ipatool downloads the components it needs. This can take a few minutes, so keep your network connected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ipatool 许可（MIT）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ipatool License (MIT)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“ipatool”想要使用钥匙串中的机密信息": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“ipatool” wants to use confidential information stored in your keychain"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载位置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download Location"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载完成的安装包会记录在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finished downloads are recorded here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载所用账号的地区": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Region of the account used for this download"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载最新版": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download Latest"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不同地区账号的版本列表与授权可能不同，需要重新获取。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version lists and licenses can differ between regions, so they need to be fetched again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不在 MIT 范围内": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not covered by MIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中国大陆": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mainland China"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从列表移除": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove from List"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从记录移除": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove from History"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会先保存并退出当前账号，再登录新账号；新账号的密码保存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current account's session is saved and signed out first, then the new account signs in. Its password is stored in this Mac's keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会删除它保存的会话与钥匙串里的密码。下载记录不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its saved session and the password in the keychain will be deleted. Download history is not affected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "允许": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "免费": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "共 %lld 个版本，最新在上 · 已加载 %lld 个版本号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld versions, newest first · %lld version numbers loaded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关于": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其他": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内置 ipatool": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bundled ipatool"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换会重新登录 Apple ID，请稍候。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switching signs in to the Apple ID again. Please wait."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换到": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch to"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换到 %@ 账号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch to %@ Account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换失败": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换失败，正在恢复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch failed, restoring"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换失败，正在恢复 %@ 账号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch failed, restoring the %@ account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换账号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换账号失败": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't Switch Accounts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "历史版本…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Older Versions…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双重认证": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two-Factor Authentication"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发布地址尚未配置，暂不能检查更新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The release location isn’t configured yet, so updates can’t be checked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消切换": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel Switch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "另一个账号切换正在进行，请稍后再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another account switch is in progress. Try again later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只清理 IPA Depot 自己的缓存，不影响 ipatool 的组件缓存与登录状态。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only IPA Depot’s own cache is cleared. ipatool’s component cache and sign-in are not affected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只清除记录，不会删除已下载的安装包文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the history is cleared. Downloaded IPA files are not deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "台湾": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Taiwan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "向 Apple 查询需要一点时间，通常在 30 秒内完成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asking Apple takes a moment, usually less than 30 seconds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "商店地区跟随账号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Store Region Follows Your Account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "图标缓存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icon Cache"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在搜索页点「下载最新版」，或在历史版本里选择一个版本下载。任务会依次进行，同一时间只下载一个。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Download Latest” in Search, or pick a version under Older Versions. Downloads run one at a time, in order."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在访达中显示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show in Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地区": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Region"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地区标签": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Region label"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "基于 majd/ipatool（MIT）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Built on majd/ipatool (MIT)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "始终允许": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always Allow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Password"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码保存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串中。切换账号会重新登录，第一次切到某个账号可能需要验证码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passwords are stored in this Mac's keychain. Switching accounts signs in again, and the first switch to an account may ask for a verification code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码保存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串中，切换时自动登录。地区只能通过换账号改变，标签仅用于区分。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passwords are stored in this Mac's keychain and used to sign in automatically when switching. The region can only change by switching accounts; the label is just for telling them apart."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码只在本机使用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your password stays on this Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码只用于在这台 Mac 上向 Apple 登录，不会上传到其他任何地方。为了一键切换账号，IPA Depot 会把它保存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your password is only used to sign in to Apple from this Mac and is never uploaded anywhere else. To switch accounts in one click, IPA Depot stores it in this Mac's keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码只用于在这台 Mac 上向 Apple 登录，不会上传到其他任何地方，IPA Depot 也不会保存它。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your password is only used to sign in to Apple from this Mac. It is never uploaded anywhere else, and IPA Depot does not store it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码已保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Password saved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码待补": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Password needed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尚未登录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not Signed In"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尚未登录 Apple ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not signed in to an Apple ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已保存的账号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved accounts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已切换到 %@ 账号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switched to the %@ account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已切换到 %@ 账号，请重新搜索": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switched to the %@ account. Please search again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已取消切换。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The switch was cancelled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Completed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已恢复为原来的 %@ 账号。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restored the previous %@ account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已是最新版本（%@）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You’re up to date (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已暂停": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paused"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已暂停 · 上次失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paused · Last attempt failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已登录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signed In"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已退出登录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signed out"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "平台": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Platform"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开源组件": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Source"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Current"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前版本 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Current version %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复 %@ 账号需要验证码": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restoring the %@ account needs a verification code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复默认": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore Default"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开下载文件夹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Downloads Folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开下载页面": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Download Page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找不到 ipatool": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ipatool Not Found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找不到该账号，可能已被移除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The account wasn't found. It may have been removed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拒绝": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deny"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拷贝 App ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy App ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拷贝 Bundle ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy Bundle ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "授权框不在登录时出现：登录成功后第一次搜索会弹一次，第一次查看历史版本或下载时再弹一次（两条不同的钥匙串记录），都要输入这台 Mac 的登录密码。两次都选「始终允许」后不再询问。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
